      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Width = speed × time\n= 6 × 1/3\n= 2 km.\n\nThe current is not needed when the question only asks how much width is cleared in this drift-allowed setup.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
