      "id": "teach_3",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The current still causes sideways drift.\n\nIf current = 3 km/hr and crossing time = 15 minutes = 1/4 hour, the river carries the swimmer:\n3 × 1/4 = 0.75 km sideways.",
